---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import underConstruction from "../images/under-construction.webp";
import dbSteveNoArm from "../images/db-steve-no-arm.webp";
---

<MainLayout>
  <section class='projects-section'>
    <h1>Projects Page</h1>

    <div class='projects-hero-wrapper'>
      <div class='text-wrapper'>
        <p>
          I put together the Nascar page first, which is still missing the
          golden content... I have over an hour and a half of All-Star Race
          footage I shot while I was on pitroad all weekend. I still need to
          edit a video from it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Next I pumped the music page up a bit with content, I do still have
          some gems to add as time permits, and I am going to try to continue to
          keep the music haul posts up to date.
        </p>
        <p>
          Now it's time for this page. I am planning some demo videos and links
          for some things that I have built. I am also thinking of having a
          photo gallery for all the versions of my characters.
        </p>
        <p>
          The first project I want to demo for you is The Majewski Collection
          App. It's a desktop app I made with Electron that I use to manage my
          database for my music collection's catalog. I am almost done with the
          video's intro and will post that as kind of a trailer soon.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Image
        src={underConstruction}
        alt='a decorative image'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='currency-exchange-wrapper'>
      <div class='text-wrapper form-shadow'>
        <p>
          Early in my coding journey, when I was learning how to fetch API data,
          I made this currency converter. It's not a very complicated app, but I
          always liked the way it looked. For the flag displays, I had an image
          in my mind of the dials and instruments you would see on an airplane's
          instrument panel. After you convert, you can just change the values to
          do it again.
        </p>
        <div class='image-wrapper'>
          <Image
            src={dbSteveNoArm}
            alt=''
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <iframe
        class='form-shadow'
        title='My Currency Exchange Calculator App'
        src='https://resonant-biscuit-cdf86d.netlify.app/'
        sandbox='allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-modals'
        allow=''
        referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin'
      ></iframe>
    </div>
    <!-- <CodecademyCerts /> -->
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .currency-exchange-wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 400px), 1fr));
    padding-inline: 1rem;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;

    .text-wrapper {
      max-width: 400px;
      outline: 2px solid var(--text-color-700);
      padding: 1rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      display: grid;
      gap: 2rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;

      &::before {
        content: "";
        width: 35px;
        height: 35px;
        background-image: url("/images/boid.svg");
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        position: absolute;
        top: 75%;
        z-index: 9999;
        transform: scale(0);
        animation: bird-fly 20s var(--bird-delay) linear infinite;
      }
    }

    .image-wrapper {
      max-width: 35%;
      margin-inline: auto;
      position: relative;

      &::after {
        content: "";
        width: 50px;
        height: 25px;
        position: absolute;
        top: 0.5rem;
        z-index: -1;
        background-image: url("/images/airplane.webp");
        background-size: contain;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        animation: fly-the-plane 30s linear infinite;
      }
      &::before {
        content: "";
        width: 13px;
        height: 47px;
        position: absolute;
        display: block;
        background-image: url("/images/db-steve-arm.webp");
        background-size: contain;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        transform-origin: bottom left;
        animation: wave-arm 20s ease-out infinite;
        right: 13%;
        top: 32%;

        z-index: 99;
      }

      img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        rotate: -10deg;
        animation: float-steve 20s ease-out infinite;
      }
    }
  }

  iframe {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    height: 625px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    border: none;
    outline: 2px solid var(--text-color-700);
  }
  .projects-section {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1rem;

    .projects-hero-wrapper {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 60ch), 1fr));
      align-items: start;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-block: 3rem;
      justify-items: center;

      .text-wrapper p:not(:last-child) {
        margin-block-end: 1lh;
      }

      .text-wrapper p {
        max-width: 60ch;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        margin-block: 1.5rem;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
    }
  }
  @keyframes fly-the-plane {
    from,
    to {
      right: -150%;
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }

    49% {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }

    99% {
      transform: scaleX(-1);
    }

    50% {
      right: 225%;
      transform: scaleX(-1);
    }
  }

  :root {
    --bird-farthest-right: 20%;
    --bird-farthest-left: 70%;
    --bird-delay: 0s;
  }

  @keyframes bird-fly {
    0% {
      right: var(--bird-farthest-right);
      transform: scaleX(1) scale(0);
    }
    15% {
      right: calc(var(--bird-farthest-right) + 10%);
    }

    18% {
      right: calc(var(--bird-farthest-right) + 15%);
      transform: scaleX(1) scale(1);
    }
    20% {
      right: calc(var(--bird-farthest-right) + 20%);
      transform: scaleX(1) scale(1);
    }
    30% {
      right: calc(var(--bird-farthest-left) - 10%);
      transform: scaleX(1) scale(1);
    }
    35% {
      right: var(--bird-farthest-left);
      transform: scaleX(1) scale(0.2);
    }
    37% {
      right: var(--bird-farthest-left);
      transform: scaleX(-1) scale(0.2);
      z-index: -999;
    }
    45% {
      right: var(--bird-farthest-right);
      transform: scaleX(-1) scale(0.2);
      z-index: -999;
    }

    /* 50% {
      right: calc(var(--bird-farthest-right) + 10%);
      transform: scaleX(-1) scale(1);
    }
    60% {
      right: 115%;
      transform: scaleX(-1) scale(0.6);
    }
    99% {
      right: 115%;
      transform: scaleX(-1) scale(0);
    }
    100% {
      right: var(--bird-farthest-right);
      transform: scaleX(1) scale(0);
    } */
  }

  @keyframes float-steve {
    from,
    to {
      rotate: -10deg;
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }

    50% {
      rotate: -8deg;
      transform: translate(-0.25rem, 0rem);
    }
  }

  @keyframes wave-arm {
    to,
    from {
      rotate: 0;
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }

    50% {
      rotate: 10deg;
      transform: translate(-0.25rem, 0rem);
    }
  }
</style>
